# =============================================================================
# Business Entity Resolution — .gitignore
# Rationale for every block is documented in
# reports/INITIAL_ARCHITECTURE_AND_STRATEGY.md §21 (Project Structure).
# =============================================================================

# --- Organizer-provided data (raw, read-only, large; never commit) -----------
datasets/
dataset/
data/raw/
*.tsv
!tests/fixtures/**/*.tsv

# --- Organizer-provided documents (treated as private) -----------------------
Problem Statement.docx
student_resource/
# NOTE: utils/validate_submission.py and Documentation_template.md are
# organizer files; they are ignored where they were distributed
# (student_resource/). Our filled-in methodology doc lives in docs/ and IS tracked.

# --- Derived / generated data -------------------------------------------------
data/interim/
data/processed/
data/cache/
# dev samples built from raw data (contain raw records)
data/sample*/
*.parquet
*.feather
*.arrow
*.npy
*.npz
*.h5
*.hdf5

# --- Pipeline outputs (regenerated by the pipeline; can exceed GitHub's 100 MB limit)
# The final zip is assembled by the packaging step, not from git.
output/*
!output/.gitkeep
submissions/
*.zip

# --- Model binaries & experiment artifacts ----------------------------------
models/
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.joblib
*.lgb
*.txt.model
*.cbm
*.xgb
*.onnx
*.pt
*.pth
*.bin
*.safetensors
experiments/runs/
mlruns/
wandb/

# --- Profiling outputs that embed raw record examples ------------------------
reports/profiling/*.json

# --- Python / environments ---------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.conda/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.cache/

# --- Secrets -----------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
secrets/
credentials*.json

# --- OS / editor -------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.tmp
*.log
student_resource